flowchart LR
    A[Sense] --> B[Interpret]
    B --> C[Decide]
    C --> D[Act]
    D --> E[Prove]
    E --> A

    A --> A1[Signals: escalations, retries, cost, drift]
    B --> B1[Which promise is breaking?]
    C --> C1[Who has authority?]
    D --> D1[Smallest safe intervention]
    E --> E1[Replay, tests, telemetry, evidence]
